// File:    std/slice_view_test.skink
// Purpose: Regression tests for slice-view semantics. s[a:b] with a > 0
//          produces an interior-pointer view registered with the RC
//          runtime (kind-3 entry); s[0:len] aliases the source; s[0:k]
//          with k < len copies (a thin prefix pointer cannot carry its
//          own length at payload-8 — documented limitation).
